WEBVTT

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.268
Adversity doesn't discriminate.

00:01:04.292 --> 00:01:06.184
If you are alive,

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:10.059
you are going to have to,
or you've already had to,

00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:12.684
deal with some tough times.

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:14.917
Thank you, everyone, take a seat.

00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:22.559
I started studying
resilience research a decade ago,

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:25.934
at the University
of Pennsylvania in Philadelphia.

00:01:25.958 --> 00:01:28.309
It was an amazing time to be there,

00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:30.726
because the professors who trained me